  "title": "Award-Winning Maple-Nut-Toffee Tart",
  "description": "With a buttery crust, maple-nut filling, and a chocolate drizzle topping, this award-winning toffee tart is the perfect dessert to impress at potlucks or parties.",
  "authors": [
    "larkspur"
  ],
